{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "readyroad-smoke-test-2026",
    "name": "ReadyRoad Backend - Smoke Test Suite",
    "description": "🚀 **Automated Smoke Test Suite for ReadyRoad Backend**\n\n**Purpose:** Fail-fast validation of critical endpoints with automated test scripts.\n\n**Usage:**\n1. Select 'ReadyRoad Local' environment\n2. Run entire collection (Runner or CLI)\n3. Review test results - all tests must pass\n4. If any test fails, backend is unstable\n\n**Critical Endpoints Tested:**\n- ✅ Health checks (custom + actuator)\n- ✅ Categories API\n- ✅ Traffic Signs API\n- ✅ Lessons API\n- ✅ Exam Questions API\n- ✅ OpenAPI documentation\n- ❌ Wrong paths (must return 404)\n\n**Test Scripts:** Every request includes automated assertions:\n- Status code validation\n- Response time checks\n- JSON structure validation\n- Data type verification\n\n**Run with Newman CLI:**\n```bash\nnewman run ReadyRoad.smoke-test.postman_collection.json -e ReadyRoad.local.postman_environment.json --reporters cli,html\n```\n\n**Date:** January 22, 2026 (FIXED)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔥 Smoke Tests - Critical Path",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "✅ Health Check - Custom",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Critical: Backend must be UP",
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response time is acceptable\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response is JSON\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.be.json;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Health status is UP\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql(\"UP\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response contains required fields\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('status');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('message');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('timestamp');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('version');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Save timestamp for later",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"backend_last_health_check\", new Date().toISOString());"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**CRITICAL:** Custom health endpoint must return status UP.\n\nIf this fails, backend is down or misconfigured."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
